  "independentSolve": "Set A=x²−4x. (A+2)(A+5)=0. x²−4x+5=(x−2)²+1 has no real root; x²−4x+2=0 has roots 2±√2, whose product is 2. Thus exactly two distinct real roots and answer ②.",
  "verdict": "SOURCE_CONFIRMED_CORRECTION",
